1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,450
People ask how I multitask. Simple.

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:10,050
Two thirds of my neurons are in my ARMS, not my head.

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:18,500
Each arm can think for itself.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,780
My head just says, please, everyone, behave.

5
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:30,000
I'm a team of eight with no manager.
